' SD-08. UC-008 TCP 명령 인터페이스로 컨트롤러 구동 및 상태 조회 - 우측 센서 제거 설계 버전
' Related Use Case: UC-008. TCP 명령 인터페이스로 컨트롤러 구동 및 상태 조회
' Intent: 외부 시뮬레이터/시스템 테스트 클라이언트의 line-based command가 TCP/Protocol adapter를 거쳐 우측 센서 없는 컨트롤러 입력과 상태 조회로 변환되는 흐름을 표현한다.
' Note: 이 설계 버전은 RIGHT 직접 센서 입력을 제거한다. 기존 우측 방향은 UC-003/UC-005에서 우측 90도 회전 후 전방 센서 입력으로 확인한다.

@startuml SD_08_UC008_TCP_Command_Interface_Without_Right_Sensor
hide footbox
title SD-08 - UC-008 TCP 명령 인터페이스 - 우측 센서 제거

actor "시뮬레이터/\n시스템 테스트 클라이언트" as Client
participant "TcpServer" as TcpServer
participant "CommandHandler" as Handler
participant "CommandParser" as Parser
participant "RobotVacuumApplication" as App
participant "RVCSWController" as Controller
participant "StateFormatter" as Formatter

Client -> TcpServer: newline-terminated command
activate TcpServer

alt command line exceeds 1024 bytes
    TcpServer --> Client: ERR INVALID_ARGUMENT
    TcpServer -> Client: close session
else command line accepted
    TcpServer -> Handler: handleLine(line)
    activate Handler
    Handler -> Parser: parse(line)
    activate Parser
    Parser --> Handler: ParseResult
    deactivate Parser

    alt parse failure
        Handler --> TcpServer: CommandResponse(ERR UNKNOWN_COMMAND or ERR INVALID_ARGUMENT)
    else front sensor command
        Handler -> App: setFrontObstacle(frontObstacleDetected)
        activate App
        App -> Controller: reportFrontObstacleState(frontObstacleDetected)
        Controller --> App: device commands recorded
        deactivate App
        Handler --> TcpServer: CommandResponse(OK SET_FRONT)
    else back sensor command
        Handler -> App: setBackObstacle(backObstacleDetected)
        activate App
        App -> Controller: reportBackObstacleState(backObstacleDetected)
        Controller --> App: device commands recorded
        deactivate App
        Handler --> TcpServer: CommandResponse(OK SET_BACK)
    else left sensor command
        Handler -> App: setLeftObstacle(leftObstacleDetected)
        activate App
        App -> Controller: reportLeftObstacleState(leftObstacleDetected)
        Controller --> App: device commands recorded
        deactivate App
        Handler --> TcpServer: CommandResponse(OK SET_LEFT)
    else combined sensor command without right input
        Handler -> App: setObstacleState(frontObstacleDetected, backObstacleDetected, leftObstacleDetected)
        activate App
        App -> Controller: reportObstacleState(frontObstacleDetected, backObstacleDetected, leftObstacleDetected)
        Controller --> App: device commands recorded
        deactivate App
        Handler --> TcpServer: CommandResponse(OK SET_OBSTACLES)
        note right of Controller: 기존 우측 방향은 RIGHT 입력이 아니라\n우측 90도 회전 후 FRONT 입력으로 확인
    else dust command
        Handler -> App: reportDustDetected()
        activate App
        App -> Controller: reportDustDetected()
        Controller --> App: cleaning command and timer recorded
        deactivate App
        Handler --> TcpServer: CommandResponse(OK DUST_DETECTED)
    else power timeout command
        Handler -> App: expirePowerTimer()
        activate App
        App -> Controller: increasedPowerDurationExpired()
        Controller --> App: cleaning command recorded
        deactivate App
        Handler --> TcpServer: CommandResponse(OK POWER_TIMEOUT or ERR INVALID_STATE)
    else state query
        Handler -> App: snapshot()
        App --> Handler: ControllerStateSnapshot
        Handler -> Formatter: format(snapshot)
        Formatter --> Handler: OK STATE ...
        Handler --> TcpServer: CommandResponse(OK STATE ...)
        note right of Formatter: 상태 응답은 RIGHT 직접 센서값 대신\n전방/후방/좌측과 최근 주행 명령을 제공
    else reset command
        Handler -> App: reset()
        Handler --> TcpServer: CommandResponse(OK RESET)
    else quit command
        Handler --> TcpServer: CommandResponse(OK BYE, closeSession=true)
    end
    deactivate Handler

    TcpServer --> Client: response line
end

deactivate TcpServer
@enduml
